# ==============================================================================
# AutoClaim AI: .gitignore Configuration
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Heavy Raw Image Datasets (Total ~3 GB)
# These should NEVER be pushed to GitHub due to file size and repository limits.
# Download links are documented in README.md (HuggingFace datasets).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Car_Parts_Damage_Dataset/
Comprehensive_Car_Damage/
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
# Allow evaluation plot images inside models/
!models/evaluation_plots/*.png

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Large Pre-Trained Deep Learning Weights (>100 MB GitHub Limit)
# Files over 100MB are strictly blocked by GitHub push operations.
# Host large model files on GitHub Releases, HuggingFace Hub, or Google Drive.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
model_artifacts/*.keras
model_artifacts/*.h5
model_artifacts/*.weights.h5
# Keep configuration JSON files tracked in git:
!model_artifacts/multilabel_config.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Scratch & Duplicate Files
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Untitled.ipynb
Untitled1.ipynb
/synthetic_vehicle_claims_40000.csv  # Kept inside data/synthetic_vehicle_claims_40000.csv
*.tmp
*.log

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Python & Jupyter Caches
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Virtual Environments
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Operating System & IDE Artifacts
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. Streamlit Local Cache
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.streamlit/secrets.toml
